@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
title State Machine Diagram - Payment Attempt Lifecycle v1.1

[*] --> Pending : payment attempt created

Pending --> Paid : verified provider success
Pending --> Failed : verified provider failure
Pending --> Cancelled : verified provider cancellation

Paid --> Refunded : refund confirmed\n[future scope / separate approval]

Failed --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
Paid --> [*]
Refunded --> [*]

note right of Pending
  Callback must pass provider authentication,
  reference, invoice, amount and currency checks.
  Repeated callback events are idempotent.
end note

note bottom of Paid
  Receipt is issued only after verified PAID.
  Invoice summary becomes LUNAS.
  Booking lifecycle remains unchanged.
end note

note bottom of Refunded
  Refund processing is not automatically
  included in the MVP scope.
end note
@enduml
